  "title": "Dal Makhani",
  "subtitle": "Rich, slow-cooked lentil and kidney bean dal",
  "excerpt": "Green lentils and kidney beans simmered for an hour with tomato, butter, and cream until the sauce turns thick and silky. This dal rewards low and slow cooking and gets better on the second day.",
